# Godot 项目跨平台换行统一
# .tscn / .gd / .godot 都是文本，Windows 与 macOS 混用会把整个文件标成改动
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源，不做换行转换、不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.zip binary

# 场景与脚本强制 LF，避免 Windows 提交后 diff 全红
*.gd text eol=lf
*.tscn text eol=lf
*.tres text eol=lf
*.godot text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
